(5625694, 815887, 108564, '<td valign="top">This is so wonderful I can''t talk - - I love everything about it.  Some might get on you for the noise...but it adds for me.  10!</td>', 'This is so wonderful I can''t talk - - I love everything about it.  Some might get on you for the noise...but it adds for me.  10!', '2009-08-26 23:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
