(5626967, 816581, 6999, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all - and it stopped me from the thumbnail, so that''s a good sign. A couple of things let the image down, in my opinion, when one gets to ''full size'': the crop (or possibly angle of view) just leaves everything too close to the edges - the left wing, the ruck (especially the player who appears to be smiling at someone out of frame), and indeed the ball. Like the black and white though, you''ve avoided the mistake that a lot of people make of having too much grey.</td>', 'Not bad at all - and it stopped me from the thumbnail, so that''s a good sign. A couple of things let the image down, in my opinion, when one gets to ''full size'': the crop (or possibly angle of view) just leaves everything too close to the edges - the left wing, the ruck (especially the player who appears to be smiling at someone out of frame), and indeed the ball. Like the black and white though, you''ve avoided the mistake that a lot of people make of having too much grey.', '2009-08-28 05:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5627030, 815765, 10785, '<td valign="top">I really can''t stand drama, and I am really disturbed by what I see in this picture therefore it must be truly dramatic! So I give it a 10 even though I think it is a little over processed (too smooth skin, lacking texture). I can only imagine what is coming at this person to make him resort to a cornered fork defence.</td>', 'I really can''t stand drama, and I am really disturbed by what I see in this picture therefore it must be truly dramatic! So I give it a 10 even though I think it is a little over processed (too smooth skin, lacking texture). I can only imagine what is coming at this person to make him resort to a cornered fork defence.', '2009-08-28 09:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
