(5627033, 816695, 10785, '<td valign="top">You can just hear the whispered gossip in the background that she is trying so deserately to ignore. Great emotive photo. Excellent colors! Even though it''s predominantly blue, this photo does not emit a cold feeling. This ones a 10!</td>', 'You can just hear the whispered gossip in the background that she is trying so deserately to ignore. Great emotive photo. Excellent colors! Even though it''s predominantly blue, this photo does not emit a cold feeling. This ones a 10!', '2009-08-28 09:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5627035, 816680, 10785, '<td valign="top">You have captured the dramatic feeling of the finale! I can feel the fireworks in my chest as I look at this picture. A definite 10!</td>', 'You have captured the dramatic feeling of the finale! I can feel the fireworks in my chest as I look at this picture. A definite 10!', '2009-08-28 09:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
