(5630281, 816608, 24486, '<td valign="top">I like the black &amp; white &amp; the reflections. I''m not too sure about the tilted horizon but I don''t think it really matters too much. Cropping off the persons head in the foreground I think hurts this composition. You loose the opportunity to possibly show emotion in her face.</td>', 'I like the black & white & the reflections. I''m not too sure about the tilted horizon but I don''t think it really matters too much. Cropping off the persons head in the foreground I think hurts this composition. You loose the opportunity to possibly show emotion in her face.', '2009-09-01 05:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630282, 816542, 87252, '<td valign="top">I like the documentary/ realism thing you''re going for here - there''s a nice progression through the different frames in the picture. The perspective through the door is evocative and hints at a hidden Drama. I think if you had cleaned up the details here - e.g taken the chair out of the bottom left and cropped out the printer (?) in the bottom right this would do better. Also it''s possibly a bit in need of sharpening.</td>', 'I like the documentary/ realism thing you''re going for here - there''s a nice progression through the different frames in the picture. The perspective through the door is evocative and hints at a hidden Drama. I think if you had cleaned up the details here - e.g taken the chair out of the bottom left and cropped out the printer (?) in the bottom right this would do better. Also it''s possibly a bit in need of sharpening.', '2009-09-01 05:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630283, 816740, 87252, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - I like the way you find yourself squinting to try to bring this back into focus (or is that just me?!). Subtle drama, well composed.</td>', 'Interesting shot - I like the way you find yourself squinting to try to bring this back into focus (or is that just me?!). Subtle drama, well composed.', '2009-09-01 05:21:54.000000', NULL, 1),
