(5630289, 816590, 87252, '<td valign="top">Stunning portrait - I''m not sure the pose or lighting are really dynamic enough to qualify this as dramatic - but really lovely shot anyway.</td>', 'Stunning portrait - I''m not sure the pose or lighting are really dynamic enough to qualify this as dramatic - but really lovely shot anyway.', '2009-09-01 05:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630291, 815640, 100773, '<td valign="top">First I thought this was the guy incharge of lighting in a theater, but it would appear they are tourists checking out a waterfall. So the truth is very disapointing, and the binocular adds to that impression. BUT, that said, it''s damned dramatic, and your coloring is sort of.... "hellish". 6 from me.</td>', 'First I thought this was the guy incharge of lighting in a theater, but it would appear they are tourists checking out a waterfall. So the truth is very disapointing, and the binocular adds to that impression. BUT, that said, it''s damned dramatic, and your coloring is sort of.... "hellish". 6 from me.', '2009-09-01 05:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5630292, 816820, 100773, '<td valign="top">Your shadows are great, and your b&amp;w conversion is good. But there''s something missing. It could be that it''s not propperly focused.</td>', 'Your shadows are great, and your b&w conversion is good. But there''s something missing. It could be that it''s not propperly focused.', '2009-09-01 05:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
